# "Whenever a Ninja you control enters": Bot2's Prehistoric Pet (a Dinosaur Ninja) entering is not a Ninja Bot1 controls, so the
# Katana asks Bot1 nothing and stays unattached, even though the creature is a Ninja.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Quintessential Katana
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Prehistoric Pet
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Quintessential Katana.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Prehistoric Pet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Decline
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Plains; Prehistoric Pet
Bot1.Battlefield.Quintessential Katana.AttachedTo = (absent)
Stack.Count = 0
